<form autocomplete="off" class="pneuma-emp-settings">
  <div class="pneuma-emp-settings-body">
    {{#each profiles}}
    <fieldset data-emp-profile="{{side}}">
      <legend>{{title}}</legend>
      <div class="form-group"><label for="emp-{{side}}-method">Method</label><select id="emp-{{side}}-method" name="{{side}}.method" data-method>{{selectOptions methods selected=method}}</select></div>
      <div data-shortlist-options>
        <p class="notes">Draw up to twice the required count once. The player sees only that saved shortlist and chooses X. Fewer eligible items means a smaller list.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-random-options>
        <div class="form-group"><label for="emp-{{side}}-overlap">Avoid overlapping host/option picks</label><input id="emp-{{side}}-overlap" type="checkbox" name="{{side}}.skipAffected" {{checked skipAffected}}></div>
        <p class="notes">When host shutdown disables its options, do not spend another selection on an overlapping component. If too few independent components exist, select fewer.</p>
      </div>
    </fieldset>
    {{/each}}
    <p class="notes">EMP normally disables two items. Other effects retain their own count, chooser, exclusions, and duration. All choices use the eligible items below.</p>
    <fieldset><legend>Eligible items</legend>
      <div class="form-group"><label for="emp-fashionware">Fashionware</label><input id="emp-fashionware" type="checkbox" name="includeFashionware" {{checked includeFashionware}}></div>
      <div class="form-group"><label for="emp-bioware" data-bioware-label>BioWare (Pneuma Homebrew)</label><input id="emp-bioware" type="checkbox" name="includeBioware" {{checked includeBioware}}></div>
      <p class="notes">BioWare: Grafted Muscle and Bone Lace and Enhanced Antibodies. Uncheck to exclude.</p>
      <div class="form-group"><label for="emp-foundational">Foundational</label><input id="emp-foundational" type="checkbox" name="includeFoundational" {{checked includeFoundational}}></div>
      <div class="form-group" data-foundation-weight><label for="emp-weight">Foundational weight</label><select id="emp-weight" name="foundationWeight">{{selectOptions foundationWeights selected=foundationWeight}}</select></div>
      <p class="notes">Shared by both chooser modes. Weight applies to random rolls and shortlist draws. Source-specific protections still apply.</p>
    </fieldset>
    <fieldset><legend>When an Internal Frame is disabled</legend>
      <div class="form-group"><label for="emp-frame-move">User cannot move</label><input id="emp-frame-move" type="checkbox" name="frameNoMove" {{checked frameNoMove}}></div>
      <div class="form-group"><label for="emp-frame-reduce">MOVE reduced by</label><input id="emp-frame-reduce" type="checkbox" name="frameReduceMove" {{checked frameReduceMove}}><input aria-label="MOVE reduction amount" type="number" min="0" step="1" name="frameMoveReduction" value="{{frameMoveReduction}}"></div>
      <div class="form-group"><label for="emp-frame-actions">Apply a penalty to all actions</label><input id="emp-frame-actions" type="checkbox" name="frameActionPenalty" {{checked frameActionPenalty}}></div>
      <div class="form-group"><label for="emp-frame-penalty">Penalty amount (subtracted)</label><input id="emp-frame-penalty" type="number" min="0" step="1" name="framePenalty" value="{{framePenalty}}"></div>
      <p class="notes">Optional consequences for installed Internal/Implanted Linear Frames. All options are off by default. Cannot move takes precedence over MOVE reduction; reduced MOVE cannot fall below zero. Penalties do not stack across repeated hits; they end when disablement ends. The GM can reposition tokens.</p>
    </fieldset>
    <div class="form-group"><label for="emp-hardened">Hardened cyberware/electronics</label><select id="emp-hardened" name="hardened">{{selectOptions hardenedMethods selected=hardened}}</select></div>
    <p class="notes">EMP/Microwaver only. Included hardened items consume a selection without being disabled or rerolled. Hardening does not protect against Quickhacks. Uses native self, installed-child and sibling shielding.</p>
    <div class="form-group"><label for="emp-immunity">EMP: immune items</label><textarea id="emp-immunity" name="immunity" rows="3">{{immunity}}</textarea><p class="notes">Exact item names or compendium source UUIDs, separated by semicolons. Applies to EMP/Microwaver direct selection; host shutdown can still affect installed options.</p></div>
  </div>
  <footer class="sheet-footer flexrow"><button type="submit"><i class="fas fa-save"></i> Save EMP behavior</button></footer>
</form>
